{"action_ordinal":2,"episode_id":"r1ep-fd3471b31d18c235f1aea88df31152d4","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0002","observation_sha256":"5cf71209a97fe60258ac4ef356aa8e5373a3bbc3d43cee96efaad89ebc8912ba","ordinal":2,"provider_round":2,"question_sha256":"d82f866ed4dae0737c5928734f3adb500944fad9cfea49678606cb643f3b56eb","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":2,"episode_id":"r1ep-fd3471b31d18c235f1aea88df31152d4","key_id":"3ff1b70de930d12a6302ffbcb5e43a039ac0cc6ee8efa1cfa1faa4c365a0f40c","ordinal":2,"provider_round":2,"question_sha256":"d82f866ed4dae0737c5928734f3adb500944fad9cfea49678606cb643f3b56eb","receipt_mac":"9b9a7bed9368e830be99b557e049544070c5ab5610557e7c397079dfbdd75bee","result_sha256":"2925d2c91a694476566a7c72d98d2aa58a8d534d79277c452be2d070f2bac8bd","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"fb38c6c1d50aeae07cd391df0e916f04520cf904ce68add77202a37c1102d1f9"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"case_sensitive":false,"max_results":80,"path":"/memories","pattern":"album"},"content":"/memories/session-05.md:L46: Dave: If I'm having trouble coming up with ideas, I usually immerse myself in something I love, like concerts or my favorite albums. Doing that usually helps to jumpstart my inspiration. Maybe try taking a break from music and explore other things. Plus, have some fun while you're at it!\n/memories/session-08.md:L12: Calvin: Hey Dave! Met with the creative team for my album yesterday. It was a long session, but awesome to see everything coming together. \n/memories/session-08.md:L15: Dave: Hey Cal! Sounds great that your album's coming along. Are you feeling good about it? Here's a pic I just took.\n/memories/session-08.md:L19: Calvin: Dave, thanks for checking in. I'm feeling stoked about this album! We've been making some magic with a team in the studio, working on the music and everything. Look at what a wonderful studio we have! How have you been? Anything new since we talked?\n/memories/session-16.md:L29: Calvin: Cool! Last weekend I started shooting a video for my new album - can't wait for you to check it out! Look how great it was!\n/memories/session-18.md:L12: Calvin: Hey Dave! Sorry it took me so long to get back to you. Crazy times since we talked! My album finally dropped on the 11th and it was a wild feeling. Everyone's been loving it and it's motivated me to keep going.\n/memories/session-18.md:L15: Dave: Hey Calvin! Congrats on your album release - that's awesome! Has it been overwhelming or inspiring?\n/memories/session-27.md:L44: Calvin: That's awesome, Dave! Your car project sounds amazing. I've had some great collaborations recently and my album is almost finished. I'll send you some previews soon. Let me know when you're free for a catch-up.\n/memories/session-28.md:L12: Calvin: Hey Dave! It's been a while! Crazy stuff has been happening. Last week I threw a small party at my Japanese house for my new album. It was amazing, so much love from my fam and friends! Take a look at the photo of the party in the mansion, it was so energizing!\n/memories/session-28.md:L16: Dave: Congrats on your album release and the party, Calvin! Must've been a great feeling having your loved ones show their support.","content_sha256":"755b472de3e836fec0c2940532a5044eb8e3fa3fb2981d0a65fe3609ec53b4b2","coverage":[{"line_end":46,"line_start":46,"path":"/memories/session-05.md"},{"line_end":12,"line_start":12,"path":"/memories/session-08.md"},{"line_end":15,"line_start":15,"path":"/memories/session-08.md"},{"line_end":19,"line_start":19,"path":"/memories/session-08.md"},{"line_end":29,"line_start":29,"path":"/memories/session-16.md"},{"line_end":12,"line_start":12,"path":"/memories/session-18.md"},{"line_end":15,"line_start":15,"path":"/memories/session-18.md"},{"line_end":44,"line_start":44,"path":"/memories/session-27.md"},{"line_end":12,"line_start":12,"path":"/memories/session-28.md"},{"line_end":16,"line_start":16,"path":"/memories/session-28.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582